        en: '3 evolutionary stages: bright detailed helm with 3D war-tusks (1) -> dulled weathered helm shrouding jawless Orc cranium with snapped tusk and ash sweeping up-right from behind helm (2) -> darkened ravaged helm with arrow, glowing coals erupting from jaws, moderate background fire behind helm, and subdued right-eye ember (3).'
