        en: "3 bestiary evolution invariants: petrified black-ebony shed rings & dried poison shoulder glaze gripping The Maelstrom's Eye below dormant Sethrakul's Crest (1) -> awakened Leviathan serpent & single Hammerfell Fang katana (2) -> roaring fanged maw, crossed Twin Fangs ×2, storm-wave wake & Maelstrom vortex (3)."
